required significant manual coordination. Routine transactions now move through more structured workflows, exceptions are identified earlier, and our teams have clearer visibility into outstanding activities. This has improved operational efficiency while maintaining the controls required across our banking environment.","”"]}],"$L27"]}]}]}]
